      "start_line": 11,
      "text": "  rule digitSumIS(iCons(C:Int, REST:IntSeq))\n    => (#if isUpperC(C) andBool notBool isLowerC(C)\n        #then C\n        #else 0\n        #fi)\n       +Int digitSumIS(REST)"
